_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Die in 60 seconds</strong> - and do it with style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad \u2026and many other chaotic modes no serious game would dare include.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and did we mention the <strong>giant clown</strong> who drops in to \u201crestore order\u201d on the map?<br>Yeah. That\u2019s a thing. He\u2019s huge. He\u2019s angry. And he\u2019s got opinions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/bf85a71c91be7c6c268ab4d9e2892393.poster.webp?t=1751901252\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/bf85a71c91be7c6c268ab4d9e2892393.webp?t=1751901252\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Up to <strong>6 players</strong> in online mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>10 handcrafted maps</strong> full of secrets, hazards, and humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiple game modes</strong>: from classic catch-and-swap to pure nonsense carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Insane abilities</strong>: traps, teleportation, disguise as random objects, balloon flight, broomsticks - yes, actual broomsticks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2a <strong>A world where chaos is an art form</strong>, and laughter is your only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/0e70ab22edb91571323c052595e71e45.poster.webp?t=1751901252\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/0e70ab22edb91571323c052595e71e45.webp?t=1751901252\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLOWNOUT</strong> isn\u2019t just a game.<br>It\u2019s a <strong>multiplayer madhouse</strong> where you either laugh, or get hammered (literally).<br>Choose your side - or just start the riot.</p>",
